":"தந்தை","gloss":"father"}],"gloss":"father"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வெண்கடைச்","parts":[{"text":"வெண்கடைச்","lemma":"வெண்கடைச்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறுகோ","parts":[{"text":"சிறுகோ","lemma":"சிறுகோ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"லகவன்","parts":[{"text":"லகவன்","lemma":"லகவன்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"மகளிர்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"மட","parts":[{"text":"மட","lemma":"மடமை","gloss":"gentle"}],"gloss":"gentle"},{"surface":"பிடி","parts":[{"text":"பிடி","lemma":"பிடி","gloss":"female elephant"}],"gloss":"female elephant"},{"surface":"பரிசில்","parts":[{"text":"பரிசில்","lemma":"பரிசில்","gloss":"gift"}],"gloss":"gift"},{"surface":"மான","parts":[{"text":"மான","lemma":"மான","gloss":"to resemble"}],"gloss":"resembling"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிறிது","parts":[{"text":"பிறிது","lemma":"பிறிது","gloss":"other"}],"gloss":"other"},{"surface":"ஒன்று","parts":[{"text":"ஒன்று","lemma":"ஒன்று","gloss":"one"}],"gloss":"thing"},{"surface":"குறித்தது","parts":[{"text":"குறித்தது","lemma":"குறி","gloss":"intended"}],"gloss":"intended"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"அவன்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"நெடும்","parts":[{"text":"நெடு","lemma":"நெடுமை","gloss":"long"},{"text":"ம்","lemma":"ம்","gloss":"adjectival suffix"}],"gloss":"long"},{"surface":"புறம்","parts":[{"text":"புறம்","lemma":"புறம்","gloss":"back"}],"gloss":"back"},{"surface":"நிலை","parts":[{"text":"நிலை","lemma":"நிலை","gloss":"standing"}],"gloss":"standing"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]}],"literal":"To reach the neighborhood, gently coming and coming, / rarely speaking out, sweet words having spoken, / every day, with changed complexion, he who stays, / his sorrowful look, do consider, O friend! / Of Akutai, who has sweet and strong toddy, the father, / white-tipped small staff holding, the singing women, / a gentle female elephant as a gift, resembling, / intending something else, his standing at the long back indeed.","translation":"Coming gently again and again to reach our neighborhood, rarely speaking out but saying sweet words, his complexion changing day by day as he lingers—O friend, do think of his sorrowful look! Like the singing women holding small, white-tipped staffs who receive a gentle female elephant as a gift from the father of Akutai, who possesses sweet, strong toddy, his standing there at the long back of our house, waiting, surely intends something else.","modern":"நம்முடைய சேரிக்கு மெல்ல மெல்லத் திரும்பத் திரும்ப வந்து, அரிதாகத் தன் வாயைத் திறந்து சில இனிய சொற்களைக் கூறி, நாள்தோறும் தன் நிறம் வேறுபட்டுத் தங்கியிருக்கும் அவனுடைய துன்பம் நிறைந்த பார்வையைத் தோழியே நீ சிந்தித்துப் பார். இனிய, கடுமையான கள்ளையுடைய அகுதையின் தந்தை, வெண்மையான முனையையுடைய சிறிய கோலைக் கையில் ஏந்திய பாடினி மகளிர்க்கு இளமையான பெண் யானையைப் பரிசாக வழங்குவது போல, நம் வீட்டின் நீண்ட புறத்தே அவன் வந்து நிற்பது வேறு ஏதோ ஒன்றை (உன்னை மணமுடிக்கக் கேட்பதை) மனதிற் கொண்டுதான்.","explanation":"The friend (தோழி) is speaking to the heroine (தலைவி) about the hero's persistent visits. He has been coming to their neighborhood secretly, speaking very little but with sweet words, and waiting outside their house with a changing, distressed complexion. The friend urges the heroine to consider his sorrowful look and understand his deep love. She compares his waiting outside to the singing women who stand with their small white-tipped staffs, waiting to receive a grand gift (a female elephant) from the generous father of the chieftain Akutai. Just as those women wait for a precious gift, the hero stands outside waiting for the ultimate gift of the heroine's hand in marriage.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}